-- E2E fixture data set for authors: people and groups with their labels, locations and memberships. Stable ids: tests may reference them.
-- Enough entries for more than one page of 100 in both catalogs, under Latin, Cyrillic and the rest letters.
-- Every person has a real name of the country they live in and a preferred nickname, but one known only by the real name.
-- Members are labels: some people are members under a former nickname; some labels belong to nobody known yet.
-- Person ...0003-{n}; label k of person n ...0004-{n * 10 + k}; label k of group g ...0004-{900000 + g * 10 + k};
-- label of nobody ...0004-{800000 + k}; group ...0005-{g}; location k of person n ...0006-{n * 10 + k}, of group g ...0006-{500000 + g * 10 + k}.
-- Locations refer to the geo fixtures (R__1_geo.sql).
